        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8457, Sandcast Bronze Single Cylinder Arched Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arched Sandcast Bronze Single Cylinder Deadbolt features a cylinder cover for a traditional, clean look. The #1 Single Cylinder Covered Deadbolt is made by Emtek and is available in 3 rustic finishes. It will fit doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches thick to 3 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sandcast Bronze Arched # 1 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid bronze collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Traditional Arched Sandcast Bronze Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1⁄4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
